# Keep the Docker build context minimal and deterministic. The image build only
# reads the workspace manifests, crate sources, and harness files under docker/.
# Everything else (target/, .git/, .references/, node_modules/, docs/) is
# excluded so context upload stays fast and no local state leaks into image
# layers.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!docker/
